Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Shoot prep lists: edit an item's text after it's added
 (pencil / double-click, Enter saves, Esc cancels)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01U4oDX1H7ERNxrdau8rNT6Y
---
 app/globals.css           |  4 ++++
 components/ShootsBoard.js | 30 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 2 files changed, 31 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/globals.css b/app/globals.css
index e26c8b2..6e8eadc 100644
--- a/app/globals.css
+++ b/app/globals.css
@@ -5942,6 +5942,10 @@ pre { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
 .prep-list .shoot-check label span { flex: 1; }
 .prep-x { flex: none; width: 1.6rem; height: 1.6rem; border: 0; border-radius: 50%; background: transparent; color: var(--ink-soft); font: inherit; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1; cursor: pointer; opacity: 0.55; margin-top: -0.1rem; }
 .prep-x:hover { opacity: 1; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); color: #c0392b; }
+.prep-pen { font-size: 0.95rem; }
+.prep-pen:hover { color: var(--ink); }
+.prep-edit { flex: 1; min-width: 0; font: inherit; font-size: 0.92rem; color: inherit; background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--field-line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.2rem 0.45rem; }
+.admin-shell.is-dark .prep-edit { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25); }
